{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/hypergraphs\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/bconnectedvertices(from:)"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}],"externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP11HypergraphsE18bConnectedVertices4fromSay6VertexQzGAH_tF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Hypergraphs\/DirectedHypergraphAlgorithms.swift#L318"},"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"Hypergraphs","relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"]}],"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","title":"bConnectedVertices(from:)"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Every vertex B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" included, in vertex-index order: Gallo et"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"al.‘s B-Visit (halp’s "},{"code":"b_visit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"). A hyperedge fires once every one of its sources has been"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached, and then reaches all its targets. On a directed graph read as a hypergraph this is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reachability."}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/bConnectedVertices(from:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bConnectedVertices"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"from"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"source"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols18DirectedHypergraphP6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"B-connection here is path-based, as B-Visit computes it: "},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is B-connected to "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when "},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or some hyperedge with "},{"code":"v","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" among its targets is entered along a path"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from "},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (it has a source, and all its sources are B-connected). So "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"a hyperedge with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no sources never fires"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no path enters it, and B-Visit scans only the forward stars of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reached vertices. The recursive reading (“every source is B-connected”) would fire it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vacuously from any start; Gallo et al.’s visit and halp do not."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"code":"source","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is a vertex.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"O(n + m + p): one counter per hyperedge and one queue; one hash.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Complexity","type":"aside","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://Hypergraphs/documentation/Hypergraphs":{"url":"\/documentation\/hypergraphs","title":"Hypergraphs","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Hypergraphs\/documentation\/Hypergraphs","type":"topic"},"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/DirectedHypergraph/Vertex":{"url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/directedhypergraph\/vertex","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/DirectedHypergraph\/Vertex","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"associatedtype","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"identifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"Vertex"},"doc://Hypergraphs/docu